        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 132665,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which HTTP method is used to send data to the server?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>POST</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>GET</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>POST</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Your <code>/players</code> collection has ten players. You submit a new profile to add an eleventh. Which method fits?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>POST</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>GET</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>PUT</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>PATCH</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>POST</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "PUT Body - Copy",
            "id": 132677,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Create a <code>PUT</code> endpoint.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.put(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/users&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"get\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>put</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Register <code>/users</code> for requests that replace user data, rather than read, create, partially update, or delete it.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.put(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/users&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"post\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"patch\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"delete\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>put</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #22",
            "id": 132686,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What HTTP status code is typically returned when a <code>PATCH</code> request successfully updates a resource?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>200 OK</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>201 Created</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>200 OK</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A <code>PATCH</code> request changes an existing user and succeeds. Which status should the server return?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>200 OK</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>201 Created</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>204 No Content</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>404 Not Found</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>200 OK</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #23",
            "id": 132687,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What should the server return if the resource to be patched is not found?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>404 Not Found</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>400 Internal Server Error</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>200 OK</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>404 Not Found</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>One <code>PATCH</code> request targets a missing user. Another targets an existing user but omits an email required by that endpoint.</p><p>Which status codes fit these failures, in that order?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>404</code>, then <code>400</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>400</code>, then <code>404</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>404</code>, then <code>200</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>500</code>, then <code>400</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>404</code>, then <code>400</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: PUT Body JSON - Copy",
            "id": 132679,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Create a <code>PUT</code> endpoint to update a specific pet.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.put(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/pet/:id&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Moo!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"post\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"13\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Moo!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>app</code> followed by <code>.</code> and then <code>put</code>, <code>/pet</code>, <code>/:id\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete the route that replaces the pet identified by <code>/pet/:id</code> and logs <code>Moo!</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.put(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/pet/:id&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Moo!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"post\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"patch\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/users/:id\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Moo!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>app</code>, followed by <code>.</code>, <code>put</code>, <code>/pet</code>, and finally <code>/:id\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: POST Body 2 - Copy",
            "id": 132690,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Set the correct code to indicate the operation was a success.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.delete(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/users/:id&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.status(\" /><text value=\"204\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"201\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"User deleted\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>204</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Finish the successful deletion with the no-content status and no response body.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"delete\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/users/:id&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"req\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"res\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"res\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"status\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"204\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"send\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"201\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"status\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>204</code>, followed by <code>send</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 132666,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What should the server do when it receives the POST request?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Save the data with the given fields</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Update an existing article with the same name</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Save the data with the given fields.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Two player records exist. You create another through <code>POST /players</code> with <code>username</code> set to <code>DauT</code>.</p><p>Which result matches this creation request?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Three records, including a new record with username DauT.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Two records, with an existing player replaced by DauT.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Two unchanged records; the request only returns player data.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Three records, including a new record with username DauT.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "PUT Body 2 - Copy -  - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 132683,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Send back a message and set the correct status code.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.patch(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/users/:id&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;User updated&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"json\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"status(201)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"User updated\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>res</code> followed by <code>.</code> and then <code>status(200)</code>, <code>.</code>, <code>send</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Respond to the successful <code>PATCH /users/:id</code> with status <code>200</code> and the plain text <code>User updated</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.patch(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/users/:id&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;User updated&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"json\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"status(201)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"req\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"User updated\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>res</code>, followed by <code>.</code>, <code>status(200)</code>, <code>.</code>, and finally <code>send</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 132676,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>When creating a <code>PUT</code> endpoint, do we typically need a route parameter?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Yes, to identify the resource</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">No, the resource to update is determined from the request body</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Yes, to identify the resource.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A request replaces the player at <code>/players/42</code>. Why does the <code>PUT</code> route need <code>:id</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">It identifies the player to update.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">It stores all replacement fields in the URL.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">It makes the request a <code>POST</code>.</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">It creates a new player automatically.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">It identifies the player to update.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "POST Body - Copy",
            "id": 132668,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Create a <code>POST</code> endpoint.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.post(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/users&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"8\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>post</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "POST Body 2 - Copy - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 132671,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Access the <code>username</code> property of the request data.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.post(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/players&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requestData = req.body;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" username = requestData.username;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(username);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"106\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"98\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"body\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"DauT\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>requestData</code>, followed by <code>.</code>, and finally <code>username</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Read the submitted username from the body stored in this callback, then log it.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.post(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/players&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requestData = req.body;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" username = requestData.username;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(username);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"106\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"98\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"password\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"res.body\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"req.params\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"DauT\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>requestData</code>, followed by <code>.</code>, and finally <code>username</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          }
        ]
